    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-χῠμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προχέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wine that flows from the
				grape</i> without pressing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				6.16.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυκτήρ</span>
			 (expld. as a <i>vessel in which cups are washed</i>), Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.422
			</span></i> P. (s.v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			in building, <i>projection</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					166.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
